# "You may exile a nonland card from among them." The top three are a Lightning Bolt, an Island and a Forest: the lands may not be
# chosen (refused, the Bolt being the positive control in the plotting scenario), and declining the Bolt puts all three cards into
# hand with nothing exiled or plotted (the Bolt can't be cast from exile on turn 3).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Make Your Own Luck
Forest
Lightning Bolt
Island
Forest
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x27

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Make Your Own Luck.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Choose(Island)
Bot1.Choose()
? Exile.Count = 0
? Bot1.Hand = Forest; Forest; Island; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 6
